# Offline Sync Rules

The app must work in poor internet conditions.

Requirements:
- Store pending alerts locally
- Sync automatically when connection returns
- Persist GPS points offline
- Queue unsent actions
- Retry failed requests
- Prevent duplicate syncs
- Use local database caching
- Detect connectivity changes
- Show sync status to user

Critical alerts:
- Must NEVER be lost
- Must retry automatically
- Must persist after app restart
